page 1 80x24 fill spaces
|        Часть букв занимает две клетки.                                         |
|        Из-за этого экраны станции ломаются.                                    |
|        Some characters take two cells. This breaks the screens.                |
|        Kai kurie simboliai užima du langelius. Dėl to ekranai suyra.           |
|                                                                                |
|        Включите одну клетку и войдите снова.                                   |
|        Set them to one cell and connect again.                                 |
|        Nustatykite vieną langelį ir prisijunkite iš naujo.                     |
|                                                                                |
|        PuTTY             Window > Translation:                                 |
|                          clear "Treat CJK ambiguous characters as wide"        |
|        Tera Term         Setup > Additional settings > Encoding:               |
|                          Ambiguous Characters width = 1 Cell                   |
|        xterm             XTerm*cjkWidth: false, or no -cjk_width               |
|        iTerm2            Settings > Profiles > Text:                           |
|                          clear "Ambiguous characters are double-width"         |
|        Windows Terminal  Settings > Compatibility:                             |
|                          Width of ambiguous characters = Narrow, restart       |
|        GNOME Terminal    Preferences > profile > Compatibility:                |
|                          Ambiguous-width characters = Narrow                   |
|        Ptyxis            Preferences > Behavior > Compatibility:               |
|                          Ambiguous-width Characters = Narrow                   |
|        R Русский   E English   L Lietuvių   Q Выйти / Exit / Išeiti            |
|                                                                                |
